  {
   "id": 532728,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Determine the surface area of the right cylinder where the radius of the base is <span data-math=\"10\\,\\text{cm}\">10\\,\\text{cm}</span>, and the height is <span data-math=\"5\\,\\text{cm}\">5\\,\\text{cm}</span>.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The surface area of a right cylinder with radius <i>r</i> and height <i>h</i> is <span data-math=\"SA = 2\\pi {r^2} + 2\\pi rh\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"SA = 2\\pi {r^2} + 2\\pi rh = 2\\pi {\\left( {10{\\text{ cm}}} \\right)^2} + 2\\pi \\left( {10{\\text{ cm}}} \\right)\\left( {{\\text{5 cm}}} \\right) \\approx 942.48{\\text{ c}}{{\\text{m}}^2}\"></span></p>\n<p>The surface area is approximately 942.48 square centimeters.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"942.48\\,\\text{cm}{^2}\">942.48\\,\\text{cm}{^2}</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
